---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Private chef in Portugal | Mediterranean Food| ByHenrique"
  description="Private chef services, personalised menus, catering and private events for dinners and special moments."
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Private Chef in Portugal · Four Shores. One Table. A Journey Across the Mediterranean
             · Private Events
          </p>

          <h1>Where Portugal, Greece, The Levant & Spain meet around one table.
              Where flavours flirt, and every meal tells a story worth sharing.
          </h1>

          <p class="lead">
            ByHenrique brings personalised menus, private chef services, private dinners and family
            events.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button" href="/en/menus">View menus</a>
            <a class="button secondary" href="/en/book">Request a quote</a>
          </div>

          <p class="language-note">
            Prefer the Portuguese version? <a href="/pt">Ver versão em Português</a>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual">
          <img
            src="/images/hummus.jpg"
            alt="Experiência de Chef privado ByHenrique"
            class="hero-visual-image"
            width="1200"
            height="900"
          />

          <div class="hero-visual-content">
            <p>ByHenrique</p>
            <h2>Private chef in Portugal</h2>
            <span>Personalised menus for special moments</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>

        <h2>A simple process, from request to table.</h2>

        <div class="steps-grid">
          <article class="card">
            <span class="step-number">1</span>
            <h3>Choose the service</h3>
            <p>
              Tell me whether you need a private chef, catering, a private event
              or a customised proposal.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <span class="step-number">2</span>
            <h3>Define the menu</h3>
            <p>
              We adjust the menu to the number of guests, occasion, preferences
              and dietary restrictions.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <span class="step-number">3</span>
            <h3>Confirm the details</h3>
            <p>
              I confirm availability, conditions, time, location and final price
              before the booking is closed.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>

                <img
            src="/images/OChefe.jpg"
            alt="O chefe Henrique"
            class="section-image"
            loading="lazy"
            width="1200"
            height="800"
        />  
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Where I am available</p>

        <h2>Private chef available in several regions of Portugal.</h2>

        <p>
          The <a href="/en/private-chef-algarve/">private chef service in Algarve</a> is
          available in <a href="/en/private-chef-faro/">Faro</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-albufeira/">Albufeira</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-vilamoura/">Vilamoura</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-quinta-do-lago/">Quinta do Lago</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-vale-do-lobo/">Vale do Lobo</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-portimao-alvor/">Portimão and Alvor</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-lagos/">Lagos</a> and{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-tavira/">Tavira</a>. The service is also
          available in <a href="/en/private-chef-alentejo/">Alentejo</a>,{" "}
          Greater <a href="/en/private-chef-lisbon/">Lisbon</a> and Central Portugal,
          including <a href="/en/private-chef-cascais/">Cascais</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-troia/">Tróia</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-comporta/">Comporta</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-grandola/">Grândola</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-alcacer-do-sal/">Alcácer do Sal</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-sines/">Sines</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-santiago-do-cacem/">Santiago do Cacém</a>,{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-leiria/">Leiria</a> and{" "}
          <a href="/en/private-chef-coimbra/">Coimbra</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="lead">
          I am available for events and private dining experiences in Marbella, 
          with transportation and accommodation arranged by the client
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    
    <section class="page-section highlight-section">
      <div class="container highlight-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Menus</p>
          <h2>Menus for different occasions.</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            From traditional options to lighter or fully customised menus, each
            request can be adapted to the occasion, season and guests’
            preferences.
          </p>

           <img
            src="/images/IMG_5073.jpg"
            alt="O Chefe Henrique"
            class="section-image"
            loading="lazy"
            width="1200"
            height="800"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Need a tailored proposal?</h3>
          <p>
            Send the details of your request and receive a menu suggestion,
            availability confirmation and quote.
          </p>
          <a class="button" href="/en/book">Send request</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
